        "@id": "urn:redstring:id:graph-1793954152871-2eopoh",
        "rdfs:label": "Axon Terminal",
        "rdfs:comment": "The tip of a neuron's axon, where it meets the next neuron at a synapse. A1 receptors on its membrane catch adenosine from the synaptic cleft and hold back the release of neurotransmitter.",
